  "description": "AvocadoSmoothie.Barista provides fast, parallel median smoothing and streamlined CSV / Excel export for large numeric sequences. It computes two median-based smoothers (Middle Median with border preservation, and All Median), reports progress, honors cancellation, and exports results with headers and charting (Excel).",
