  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Optimized GetWindowMedian to sort in-place, reducing memory pressure and GC overhead.\n\n- Added configurable BoundaryMode (Symmetric, Replicate, ZeroPad, Adaptive) applied to AllMedian; selected mode is recorded in CSV headers and displayed in Excel headers (default: Symmetric).\n\n- Extended APIs (SignatureMedian overloads, Csv / Excel OrderTickets and services) to accept and propagate BoundaryMode with backward-compatible defaults.\n\n- Added BoundaryMode (Symmetric / Replicate / ZeroPad / Adaptive) to README, examples, and API (tickets and services), clarified kernelWidth wording, and aligned CSV / Excel header documentation and progress reporting.",
